{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 03 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">状态空间与 Mamba：长程传播、扫描偏置和 3D 代价</span><span class=\"lang-en\">State Space &amp; Mamba</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_015_s4-title\">S4</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">结构化 A 矩阵使线性 SSM 可在长卷积训练与递推推理间等价切换。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Parameterizes state matrix A as Normal Plus Low-Rank (NPLR) so linear SSMs switch exact equivalence between O(N log N) convolutional training and O(1) recurrent inference.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">长一维序列 x1…xN</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Long 1D sequence x_1 … x_N</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">保留长程历史的序列表示 y1…yN</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Long-range sequence representation y_1 … y_N preserving distant history</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.2</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openreview.net/forum?id=uYLFoz1vlAC\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_015_s4')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_015_s4')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"S4 original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/13ad5aece6dafdc2f46c.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.2</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_015_s4', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_015_s4\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_015_s4')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_015_s4', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_015_s4\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">输入序列</span><span class=\"lang-en\">input sequence</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">每个时间步先投影到 SSM 通道。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests long 1d sequence x_1 … x_n and prepares initial tensor representations (input sequence).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"每个时间步先投影到 SSM 通道。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests long 1d sequence x_1 … x_n and prepares initial tensor representations (input sequence).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"输入序列\" data-node-name-en=\"input sequence\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_015_s4', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">输入序列</span><span class=\"lang-en\">input sequence</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">每个时间步先投影到 SSM 通道。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests long 1d sequence x_1 … x_n and prepares initial tensor representations (input sequence).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"定义 ḣ=Ah+Bx、y=Ch+Dx 的线性动力系统。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes continuous SSM to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"连续 SSM\" data-node-name-en=\"continuous SSM\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_015_s4', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">连续 SSM</span><span class=\"lang-en\">continuous SSM</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">定义 ḣ=Ah+Bx、y=Ch+Dx 的线性动力系统。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes continuous SSM to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"以 HiPPO/结构化参数约束状态矩阵，兼顾稳定性和长记忆。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Structured A within the core structured state space computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Structured A\" data-node-name-en=\"Structured A\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_015_s4', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Structured A</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">以 HiPPO/结构化参数约束状态矩阵，兼顾稳定性和长记忆。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Structured A within the core structured state space computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"按采样间隔把 A、B 转为离散状态更新矩阵。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs discrete within the core structured state space computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"离散化\" data-node-name-en=\"discrete\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_015_s4', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">离散化</span><span class=\"lang-en\">discrete</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">按采样间隔把 A、B 转为离散状态更新矩阵。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs discrete within the core structured state space computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"将线性递推等价为长卷积核，并用结构化计算高效生成。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs SSM Kernel within the core structured state space computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"SSM Kernel\" data-node-name-en=\"SSM Kernel\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_015_s4', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>SSM Kernel</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">将线性递推等价为长卷积核，并用结构化计算高效生成。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs SSM Kernel within the core structured state space computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"训练时对完整序列并行卷积，常通过 FFT/结构化算法实现。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs convolution within the core structured state space computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"长卷积路径\" data-node-name-en=\"convolution\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_015_s4', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">长卷积路径</span><span class=\"lang-en\">convolution</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">训练时对完整序列并行卷积，常通过 FFT/结构化算法实现。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs convolution within the core structured state space computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"推理时可按 h_t=Āh_{t−1}+B̄x_t 逐步更新。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Stage 07 within the core structured state space computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"递推状态\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 07\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_015_s4', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">递推状态</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 07</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">推理时可按 h_t=Āh_{t−1}+B̄x_t 逐步更新。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Stage 07 within the core structured state space computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"SSM 输出经非线性、门控/混合和 residual 组成深层网络。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies S4 Block to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"S4 Block\" data-node-name-en=\"S4 Block\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_015_s4', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>S4 Block</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">SSM 输出经非线性、门控/混合和 residual 组成深层网络。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies S4 Block to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"保留每步表示或汇聚为下游预测。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces long-range sequence representation y_1 … y_n preserving distant history via sequence output.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"序列输出\" data-node-name-en=\"sequence output\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_015_s4', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">序列输出</span><span class=\"lang-en\">sequence output</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">保留每步表示或汇聚为下游预测。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces long-range sequence representation y_1 … y_n preserving distant history via sequence output.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"S4 Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · S4 将结构化状态空间核化为长卷积</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · S4 Structured State-Space Kernelization via Cauchy/Woodbury Identity</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"S4：核心公式 · S4 将结构化状态空间核化为长卷积\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"15\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"11.107914pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.770213 -69.043567 265.931582 11.107914\" width=\"265.931582pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><use id=\"m015_g4-61\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m015_g1-61\"></use><path d=\"M5.597937 0V-.158807C5.032188-.208434 4.96271-.287837 4.843605-1.012393L3.910615-6.63018H3.652554L.774183-1.667471C-.009925-.34739-.10918-.23821-.506196-.158807V0H1.349857V-.158807C.843661-.208434 .764257-.258061 .764257-.506196C.764257-.694779 .794034-.784108 .962766-1.12