k:href=\"#m015_g16-23\" y=\"-59.980289\"></use><use x=\"-1.124016\" xlink:href=\"#m015_g4-61\" y=\"-59.980289\"></use><use x=\"8.726748\" xlink:href=\"#m015_g16-22\" y=\"-59.980289\"></use><use x=\"15.234333\" xlink:href=\"#m015_g7-0\" y=\"-64.094849\"></use><use x=\"20.150689\" xlink:href=\"#m015_g20-49\" y=\"-64.094849\"></use><use x=\"24.783312\" xlink:href=\"#m015_g10-185\" y=\"-59.980289\"></use><use x=\"31.428376\" xlink:href=\"#m015_g23-22\" y=\"-62.221899\"></use><use x=\"29.246569\" xlink:href=\"#m015_g16-22\" y=\"-59.980289\"></use><use x=\"37.677099\" xlink:href=\"#m015_g10-0\" y=\"-59.980289\"></use><use x=\"46.635673\" xlink:href=\"#m015_g16-30\" y=\"-59.980289\"></use><use x=\"50.680487\" xlink:href=\"#m015_g10-186\" y=\"-59.980289\"></use><use x=\"54.884701\" xlink:href=\"#m015_g16-23\" y=\"-59.980289\"></use><use x=\"61.171119\" xlink:href=\"#m015_g16-150\" y=\"-59.980289\"></use><use x=\"85.506476\" xlink:href=\"#m015_g16-32\" y=\"-59.980289\"></use><use x=\"92.628262\" xlink:href=\"#m015_g13-58\" y=\"-58.485909\"></use><use x=\"99.890068\" xlink:href=\"#m015_g4-61\" y=\"-59.980289\"></use><use x=\"108.834236\" xlink:href=\"#m015_g16-24\" y=\"-59.980289\"></use><use x=\"119.016025\" xlink:href=\"#m015_g23-22\" y=\"-62.221899\"></use><use x=\"116.834218\" xlink:href=\"#m015_g16-22\" y=\"-59.980289\"></use><use x=\"123.378167\" xlink:href=\"#m015_g13-58\" y=\"-64.094849\"></use><use x=\"130.637256\" xlink:href=\"#m015_g23-22\" y=\"-62.00769\"></use><use x=\"128.261168\" xlink:href=\"#m015_g16-23\" y=\"-59.980289\"></use><use x=\"134.54758\" xlink:href=\"#m015_g16-150\" y=\"-59.980289\"></use><use x=\"159.132\" xlink:href=\"#m015_g16-72\" y=\"-59.980289\"></use><use x=\"166.701322\" xlink:href=\"#m015_g4-61\" y=\"-59.980289\"></use><use x=\"175.954334\" xlink:href=\"#m015_g16-32\" y=\"-59.980289\"></use><use x=\"185.570419\" xlink:href=\"#m015_g10-3\" y=\"-59.980289\"></use><use x=\"192.446795\" xlink:href=\"#m015_g16-68\" y=\"-59.980289\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">RNN 难训练，CNN 与 Transformer 难稳定覆盖超长序列</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">RNNs suffer from vanishing gradients and sequential training bottlenecks, while Transformers scale quadratically O(N²) on long sequences.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">用结构化状态矩阵把长程递推等价为可高效计算的长卷积</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Initialize state matrix A with HiPPO orthogonal polynomial projections and decompose it into diagonal plus low-rank form for fast kernel evaluation.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">稳定的结构化 A 与高效 Cauchy/Vandermonde 核计算</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Mathematically unifies continuous-time ODEs, O(1)-step autoregressive recurrence, and parallel FFT convolution training.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">为长 EEG 与波形提供直接机制基础，也启发后续 3D 序列适配</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Provides the mathematical foundation for long-horizon EEG, ECG, waveform modeling, and subsequent visual/3D SSMs.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">现代 SSM 的数学基础；并行训练常为近 O(N log N) 的长卷积路径，递推推理可线性扩展</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Foundational structured SSM; linear time-invariant (LTI) dynamics lack content-dependent selection until Mamba.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">结构化状态矩阵把长期记忆、数值稳定和可计算性同时纳入参数化。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">同一线性系统既可作为长卷积并行训练，也可递推执行。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">训练通常为次二次/近 O(N log N) 路径，不应与 Mamba 的选择性线性 scan 混为一谈。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Initialize state matrix A with HiPPO orthogonal polynomial projections and decompose it into diagonal plus low-rank form for fast kernel evaluation.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Mathematically unifies continuous-time ODEs, O(1)-step autoregressive recurrence, and parallel FFT convolution training.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: S4 Structured State-Space Kernelization via Cauchy/Woodbury Identity.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">适合 EEG、ECG 等长生理序列的高效长程建模研究。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">把 2D/3D 影像展平给 S4 仍需额外空间扫描设计，原模型不天然理解体拓扑。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Provides the mathematical foundation for long-horizon EEG, ECG, waveform modeling, and subsequent visual/3D SSMs.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Foundational structured SSM; linear time-invariant (LTI) dynamics lack content-dependent selection until Mamba.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://openreview.net/forum?id=uYLFoz1vlAC\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Efficiently Modeling Long Sequences with Structured State Spaces</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/state-spaces/s4\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}